<title>HUNGARY: KEKKUTI 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT 103.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KEKKUTI 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT 103.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		125.2	vs    94.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  103.5	vs    82.8</p>
<p>    Net sales		     1,165.7	vs   838.1</p>
<p>    Other revenue		    23.4	vs    42.9</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	 761.8	vs   577.7</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     153.2	vs    86.7</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    149.0	vs   110.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   14.6 loss vs    15.5 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     7.2	vs     4.3</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	21.8	vs    19.8</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	7.1 loss vs     3.7 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Kekkuti Asvanyviz Rt is a mineral water bottler and</p>
<p>distributor. The 1996 figures are not audited. The figures were</p>
<p>prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
